named('t_52fdda90e9ab','J/J40/J40nB494.xml','黃檗和尚示眾云：『汝等盡是噇酒糟漢，恁麼行腳取笑於人，還知大唐國裏無禪師麼？』','Huangbo Xiyun','Rain Mountain Record (雨山和尚語錄) explicitly introduces a quotation from Huangbo Xiyun; Huangbo rebukes his assembly for traveling on foot only to invite ridicule.')
nonmaster('t_52fdda90e9ab','J/J25/J25nB171.xml','陳操尚書請雲門齋，纔見便問：『儒書中即不問，三乘十二分教自有座主，作麼生是衲僧行腳事？』','Minister Chen Cao','questioner','Tianyin Record (天隱和尚語錄) quotes the explicitly named minister Chen Cao asking Yunmen about the business of a patch-robed monk traveling on foot.')
named('t_395ae8fd7f32','X/X83/X83n1578.xml','我不依有住而住，不依無住而住，如是而住。','Jingangqi','Pointing at the Moon (指月錄) names Jingangqi in the immediately preceding exchange; Jingangqi answers that he dwells by depending on neither abiding nor non-abiding.')
named('t_4d83c364fefd','C/C077/C077n1710.xml','所以聲聞悟迷凡夫迷悟聲聞不知聖心本無地位因果階級','Baizhang Huaihai','Recorded Sayings of Ancient Worthies (古尊宿語錄), Baizhang Huaihai discourse: Baizhang contrasts the awakening and delusion of hearers and ordinary people while denying fixed stages in the awakened mind.')
named('t_4d83c364fefd','B/B25/B25n0145.xml','凡聖情盡迷悟見消。生佛兩忘能所俱泯。','Zhongfeng Mingben','Extensive Record of Zhongfeng (天目中峰廣錄): Zhongfeng Mingben describes genuine awakening as the disappearance of views of delusion and awakening, with ordinary and holy attitudes exhausted.')
named('t_751d6ddba1e9','C/C077/C077n1710.xml','但不著文字隔渠兩頭捉汝不得免苦樂相形免明暗相酧','Baizhang Huaihai','Recorded Sayings of Ancient Worthies (古尊宿語錄), Baizhang Huaihai discourse: Baizhang says that cutting off both sides avoids the reciprocal pairing of brightness and darkness.')
named('t_751d6ddba1e9','B/B25/B25n0145.xml','山高水深是佛境界。日上月下雲騰鳥飛是佛境界。明暗色空壞空成住','Zhongfeng Mingben','Extensive Record of Zhongfeng (天目中峰廣錄): Zhongfeng Mingben includes brightness and darkness among the conditions he identifies as the Buddha realm.')
narrated('t_2baf0ec63b2c','C/C077/C077n1710.xml','師於貞元四年正月中登建昌石門山於林中經行見洞壑平坦','the biographical compiler','Recorded Sayings of Ancient Worthies (古尊宿語錄), compiler narration: the biography reports Mazu Daoyi walking in meditation through the forest and seeing a level hollow.',[{'MasterName':'Mazu Daoyi','Roles':['person-described']}])
named('t_ccae22e8375d','P/P154/P154n1519.xml','雪竇顯云夾山畢竟不知換得一隻眼','Xuedou Chongxian','Essential and Successive Collection of the Chan School (宗門統要正續集) explicitly introduces Xuedou Chongxian’s comment that Jiashan did not realize he had exchanged for one eye.')
narrated('t_ccae22e8375d','X/X66/X66n1296.xml','後之有向此別具一隻眼，徹見從上諸老一敲一拍之所自','the named preface author Jingfu','Collection of Chan School Comments on Old Cases (宗門拈古彙集), preface prose signed by Jingfu: the author asks whether later readers will possess a distinct eye and penetrate the old masters’ actions.')
narrated('t_15eec715e731','X/X85/X85n1591.xml','取明季諸老以至於今行、超、明、實四輩語錄，共若干卷，裒然成大集，名曰黔南會燈錄','the preface composer','Record of the Lamp of Southern Guizhou (黔南會燈錄), preface narration: the composer says the collected records were assembled into a compilation named the Record of the Lamp of Southern Guizhou.')
named('t_9bdac4a01636','T/T48/T48n2017.xml','若欲萬行齊興，畢竟須依理事；理事無閡，其道在中。','Yongming Yanshou','Collection on the Shared End of Myriad Good Deeds (萬善同歸集): Yongming Yanshou says that bringing all practices forth depends on principle and phenomena without obstruction.')
named('t_9bdac4a01636','X/X82/X82n1571.xml','在臨濟則照用齊行，在雲門則理事俱備，在曹洞則偏正叶通','Heshan Huifang','Complete Collection of the Five Lamps (五燈全書), Heshan Huifang section: Huifang contrasts the houses and says that in Yunmen, principle and phenomena are both complete.')
narrated('t_fb23e0284d73','T/T51/T51n2077.xml','進具後謁汾陽葉縣。皆蒙印可。','the lamp-record compiler','Continuation of the Lamp Record (續傳燈錄), biographical narration: the compiler reports that Fushan Fayuan visited Fenyang and Yexian after ordination and received approval from both.',[{'MasterName':'Fushan Fayuan','Roles':['person-described']}])
narrated('t_fb23e0284d73','X/X84/X84n1585.xml','以風幡話契旨，蒙印可。','the lamp-record compiler','Surviving Draft of the Continued Lamp (續燈存稿), biographical narration: the compiler reports that the monk accorded with the point through the wind-and-banner case and received approval.',[])
named('t_2202e37854d4','X/X81/X81n1571.xml','王老師自小養一頭水牯牛，擬向溪東牧','Nanquan Puyuan','Complete Collection of the Five Lamps (五燈全書), Nanquan Puyuan section: Nanquan calls himself Old Master Wang and says he has raised a water buffalo since youth.')
named('t_4c9320095ba1','X/X83/X83n1578.xml','真如自性起念，六根雖有見聞覺知，不染萬境，而真性常自在。','Huineng','Pointing at the Moon (指月錄) quotes Huineng’s instruction: although the six faculties see, hear, sense, and know, they do not stain themselves on the myriad objects.')
named('t_4c9320095ba1','M/M59/M59n1540.xml','教中道法不可見聞覺知若行見聞覺知是則見聞覺知非求法也','Dahui Zonggao','Dahui’s General Addresses (大慧普覺禪師普說): Dahui Zonggao cites the teaching that the truth cannot be approached through seeing, hearing, sensing, and knowing.')
named('t_643fab6ecc1b','X/X69/X69n1357.xml','佛祖出興，特唱此段大因緣，謂之單傳心印，不立文子語句','Yuanwu Keqin','Essentials of Chan Master Foguo Keqin (佛果克勤禪師心要): Yuanwu Keqin calls the buddhas’ and patriarchs’ proclamation a singly transmitted mind-seal independent of written phrases.')
named('t_643fab6ecc1b','L/L154/L154n1639.xml','少林祕要無多子五派單傳不二門','Tianyin Yuanxiu','Recorded Sayings of Chan Master Tianyin Xiuzhe (天隱修禪師語錄): Tianyin Yuanxiu says Shaolin’s essential secret is not much, and the five branches singly transmit the nondual gate.')
named('t_338c380e905a','X/X80/X80n1565.xml','金佛不度爐。木佛不度火。泥佛不度水。真佛內裏坐。','Zhaozhou Congshen','Compendium of the Five Lamps (五燈會元), Zhaozhou Congshen section: Zhaozhou contrasts gold, wooden, and clay buddhas with the true Buddha sitting within.')
named('t_338c380e905a','C/C077/C077n1710.xml','有官人問丹霞燒木佛院主為什麼眉鬚墮落','Zhaozhou Congshen','Recorded Sayings of Ancient Worthies (古尊宿語錄), Zhaozhou Congshen section: Zhaozhou receives an official’s question about Danxia burning a wooden Buddha and the abbot losing his eyebrows.')
narrated('t_77774b8724f1','X/X83/X83n1578.xml','後因拈花因緣付法','the lamp-record compiler','Pointing at the Moon (指月錄), biographical narration: the compiler says that the Buddha later transmitted the teaching through the flower-holding encounter.',[{'MasterName':'Mahakasyapa','Roles':['person-described']}])
named('t_77774b8724f1','J/J36/J36nB369.xml','雪嶺老瞿曇從始至終將法付法','Zhe’an Fan','Recorded Sayings of Chan Master Zhe’an Fan (蔗菴範禪師語錄): Zhe’an Fan criticizes the formula of using a teaching to transmit the teaching from beginning to end.')
named('t_94be914de45d','X/X64/X64n1260.xml','靈光獨耀，逈脫根塵。體露真常，不拘文字。','Baizhang Huaihai','Record of Ancestral Principles (列祖提綱錄) explicitly introduces Baizhang Huaihai’s hall address: true constancy stands wholly exposed, unconstrained by words.')

