named('t_368268e023e3','B/B25/B25n0145.xml','如我按指海印發光。汝暫舉心塵勞先起。','Shakyamuni','Extensive Record of Zhongfeng (天目中峰廣錄) explicitly quotes a scripture here; Shakyamuni contrasts the ocean-seal shining at a finger press with defiling toil arising as soon as the mind is raised.')
