named('t_2baf0ec63b2c','J/J26/J26nB177.xml','釋迦原是小悉達，經行忽地面仰天，撞著明星刺眼瞎。','Poshan Haiming','Recorded Sayings of Chan Master Poshan (破山禪師語錄): Poshan Haiming depicts Siddhartha walking back and forth, suddenly looking upward, and being struck in the eye by the morning star.')
